  (text "ARDUINO UNO R3 SHIELD SOCKETS (female). Pin 1 of each header is at the D0 / A0 / NC / D8 end in this\nnumbering; place them on the Uno R3 hole pattern (KiCad footprint Module:Arduino_UNO_R3 has the exact positions)."
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid f9b9dd5d-c7b2-4b50-91c5-595bfc967e08)
  )
  (text "Power header 1x8: NC, IOREF (3.3 V logic level), RESET (RUN), 3.3 V, 5 V, GND, GND, VIN (+5V)."
    (at 38.1 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 3c7670c2-de16-4e67-ad67-9c6db345354a)
  )
  (text "Analog header 1x6: A0-A3 = GPIO40-43 (ADC0-3), A4 = SDA (GPIO20), A5 = SCL (GPIO21)."
    (at 127.0 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid abe6acc6-4cae-4ea3-bb66-0d6948697f1a)
  )
  (text "Digital 1x8: D0 (RX) = GPIO1, D1 (TX) = GPIO0, D2-D7 = GPIO2-7."
    (at 215.9 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 6001a316-4f1a-4527-b47e-21abd8fb35bb)
  )
  (text "Digital 1x10: D8, D9 = GPIO32, 33; D10 SS = GPIO17; D11 MOSI = GPIO19; D12 MISO = GPIO16;\nD13 SCK = GPIO18; GND; AREF (joined to +3V3 only if the solder jumper is bridged); SDA, SCL."
    (at 304.80000000000007 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid 2a53c47d-d233-488c-bfb4-6cd9a09026c0)
  )
  (text "PICO-COMPATIBLE SOCKETS: two 1x20 female headers, 17.78 mm (700 mil) apart, in the Pico pinout.\nGP0 = TX, GP1 = RX (Pico convention). GP8/GP9 are also the J7/J8 output enables and GP12-15/GP22 the\nmicroSD pins: a Pico accessory must not drive them. VBUS / VSYS are the board's +5V."
    (at 25.4 177.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid ef8ea035-3839-4e84-858a-d031f53a1e00)
  )

